activity Define Project Scope
activity Design Database Schema
activity Develop Frontend Interface
activity Implement Backend Logic
activity Integrate Payment Gateway
activity Test System Functionality
activity Deploy Application to Server
activity Monitor System Performance
activity Gather User Feedback
activity Update System Based on Feedback
bind Define Project Scope: Project Status
bind Design Database Schema: Development Time
bind Develop Frontend Interface: Budget Allocated
bind Implement Backend Logic: Payment Method
bind Integrate Payment Gateway: Number of Users
bind Test System Functionality: Transaction Volume
bind Deploy Application to Server: Deployment Environment
bind Monitor System Performance: Number of Bugs
bind Gather User Feedback: User Satisfaction
bind Update System Based on Feedback: Feedback Type
Project Status: Initiated, In Progress, Completed, Delayed
Development Time: integer between 10 and 2000
Budget Allocated: float between 1000.0 and 500000.0
Payment Method: Credit Card, PayPal, Stripe
Number of Users: integer between 0 and 1000000
Transaction Volume: float between 0.0 and 10000000.0
Deployment Environment: Development, Staging, Production
Number of Bugs: integer between 0 and 1000
User Satisfaction: float between 1.0 and 5.0
Feedback Type: Bug Report, Feature Request, Improvement Suggestion
Init[Define Project Scope] | |
Precedence[Develop Frontend Interface, Design Database Schema] | | |
Response[Integrate Payment Gateway, Implement Backend Logic] | | |
Co-Existence[Test System Functionality, Deploy Application to Server] | | |
Succession[Deploy Application to Server, Monitor System Performance] | | |
Not Precedence[Define Project Scope, Gather User Feedback] | | |
Not Response[Define Project Scope, Update System Based on Feedback] | | |
Choice[Design Database Schema, Develop Frontend Interface] | | |
Existence[Update System Based on Feedback] | |
Absence5[Test System Functionality] | |
Response[Define Project Scope, Design Database Schema] |A.Project Status is Delayed |T.Development Time > 1000 |
Response[Implement Backend Logic, Integrate Payment Gateway] |A.Payment Method is Credit Card |T.Number of Users > 1000 |0,1,h
Response[Deploy Application to Server, Monitor System Performance] |A.Deployment Environment is Production |T.Number of Bugs < 10 |0,24,h
Response[Gather User Feedback, Update System Based on Feedback] |A.User Satisfaction < 3 |T.Feedback Type is Bug Report |0,1,d
Response[Test System Functionality, Integrate Payment Gateway] |A.Transaction Volume > 1000000 |T.Number of Users > 10000 |0,7,d